    "description": "",
    "product_description": "<h3>Product Benefits</h3><div class=\"benefits-content\"><p>Stimulates Hair Growth:<br/>\u2022Rosemary extract and caffeine work synergistically to improve microcirculation in the scalp, ensuring better nutrient delivery to follicles.<br/>\u2022Regular use helps awaken dormant follicles and extend the hair\u2019s growth phase (anagen phase).</p><p>Strengthens Hair Shaft:<br/>\u2022Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5) deeply nourishes and coats hair strands, preventing breakage and split ends.<br/>\u2022Biotin supports keratin formation, enhancing hair density and texture over time.</p><p>Reduces Hair Fall &amp; Dandruff:<br/>\u2022 Niacinamide and green tea extract reduce scalp inflammation, balance sebum production, and control dandruff-causing microbes.<br/>\u2022 Aloe vera soothes irritation, restoring a healthy scalp environment.</p><p>Non-Sticky, Lightweight Finish:<br/>\u2022Water-based formula absorbs instantly without weighing hair down or leaving any residue.<br/>\u2022Perfect for hot and humid climates (like India).</p><p>Natural Aroma Therapy:<br/>\u2022Gentle rosemary and mint fragrance provides a refreshing, uplifting feel, leaving hair smelling clean and naturally herbal.</p></div><h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3><div class=\"usage-content\"><p>? Use Case:<br/>A daily scalp and hair-strengthening mist that stimulates follicles, controls hair fall, and encourages new growth. Ideal for all hair types, including oily and thin hair.</p><p>? How to Use:</p><p>Shake well before use.<br/>Spray directly onto scalp and hair roots.<br/>Gently massage for 1\u20132 minutes.<br/>Use twice daily \u2014 morning and night \u2014 for best results.<br/>Leave on; no rinse required.</p></div><h3>Ingredients</h3><p class=\"ingredients-list\"><em>(Water), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Panthenol, Glycerin, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Caffeine, Biotin, Niacinamide, Hydrolyzed Pea Protein, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Flower Water, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid, Menthol.</em></p><div class=\"product-guarantee\"><p><strong>100% Vegan &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | <strong>Formulated for Indian Skin</strong> |&nbsp;<strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong></p></div>",
    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">     <strong>Daily scalp mist that boosts growth, reduces fall and strengthens.</strong>   </p>      <h3><br/></h3><div class=\"product-guarantee\">   </div> </div>",
